internal/oracle/testdata/record_declared_keys_refused/r19_record_type.a:7:7: Adamic 0.1 refuses a value with declared properties seen through a wider index signature, which can write under a declared property what it does not hold (Options seen as Record<string, string | number | undefined>: outFile is declared string | undefined, and the index signature holds string | number | undefined); give the record no declared keys, or write the declared property by its name
